{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Dhammasavapitu","html":"<article id='thag1.108'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.108 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.108 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eleven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Dhammasavapituttheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Dhammasavapitu </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sa vīsavassasatiko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>At 120 years old </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>pabbajiṁ anagāriyaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I went forth to homelessness. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tisso vijjā anuppattā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve attained the three knowledges </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kataṁ buddhassa sāsanan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and fulfilled the Buddha’s instructions. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Dhammasavapitu thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
